vider reconstructions are byte-identical\n- local AI2-PC only, CNY 0, no canonical/production/public/remote data writes\n\n## Verdict\n\nHOLD. The result misses both the required 97% final exact-match gate and the zero-recurrence gate, so large-scale upstream candidate production is not authorized. Both residuals are preserved as safe fail-closed rejections; no in-holdout repair or tuning was performed.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1647_final_holdout.test.py -v`\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1645_layout_family_repair.test.py -q`\n- frozen manifest validation at SHA-256 `716144ce089e0057ad7cd432723da2af9b6a62152cb5327769a76b783eed2c3e`\n- compact artifact inventory: 23/23 hashes match\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n","created_at":"2026-07-21T14:58:43Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T15:37:33Z","closed_at":"2026-07-21T15:31:39Z","merged_at":"2026-07-21T15:31:39Z","merge_commit_sha":"48723bf7a79bf3776fa0d39e646726cf346026a6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1648/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1648/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1648/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/b15becbddbc865836d7ae0e5b804e533d68933b9","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1647-final-seven-paper-holdout","ref":"task/1647-final-seven-paper-holdout","sha":"b15becbddbc865836d7ae0e5b804e533d68933b9","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879",